---
const stats = [
	{
		value: '$1.4T',
		caption: 'lost globally every year to unplanned equipment downtime — roughly 11% of revenue for the world\u2019s 500 largest manufacturers.',
		source: 'Siemens, True Cost of Downtime 2024',
		color: 'text-[#f59e0b]',
	},
	{
		value: '14%',
		caption: 'of manufacturers have any prescriptive maintenance system in place. The other 86% are running blind.',
		source: 'Plant Services / Augury, 2024',
		color: 'text-[#60a5fa]',
	},
	{
		value: '30,000+',
		caption: 'mid-market plants in Canada and the US Northeast operate without a viable predictive-maintenance option.',
		source: 'MidMon market analysis, 2025',
		color: 'text-[#2dd4bf]',
	},
];
---

<section id="problem" class="relative py-28 md:py-36">
	<div class="container-x">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
			<div data-reveal class="flex justify-center">
				<span class="section-eyebrow">The Problem</span>
			</div>
			<h2 data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1" class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
				The cost of doing <span class="text-gradient-warm">nothing</span>.
			</h2>
			<p data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2" class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-[var(--color-text-muted)] md:text-lg">
				Reactive maintenance is the default for most of the manufacturing world &mdash; not
				because nobody has solved it, but because every solution that exists is built for the
				Fortune 500.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-16 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
			{
				stats.map((stat, i) => (
					<article data-reveal data-reveal-delay={String(i + 1)} class="card p-7">
						<span class="glow-ring" />
						<div class={`font-mono text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-6xl ${stat.color}`}>
							{stat.value}
						</div>
						<p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">{stat.caption}</p>
						<p class="mt-5 text-[10px] tracking-widest text-[var(--color-text-dim)] uppercase">
							{stat.source}
						</p>
					</article>
				))
			}
		</div>

		<!-- The Gap visualization -->
		<div data-reveal class="mt-16">
			<div class="card relative overflow-hidden p-8 md:p-10">
				<span class="glow-ring"></span>
				<div class="grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr]">
					<!-- Enterprise -->
					<div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-6">
						<div class="text-[10px] tracking-widest text-[var(--color-text-dim)] uppercase">Enterprise</div>
						<div class="mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold text-white">$1M+ per deployment</div>
						<ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
							<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
								<span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white/30"></span>
								Augury, Tractian — Fortune 500 only
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
								<span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white/30"></span>
								Managed onboarding, months of integration
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
								<span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white/30"></span>
								Cloud-dependent, requires data scientists on staff
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<!-- The Gap -->
					<div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center md:px-2">
						<div class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] text-[var(--color-text-dim)] uppercase">The Gap</div>
						<div class="mt-2 font-mono text-4xl font-semibold text-white md:text-5xl">30K+</div>
						<div class="mt-1 max-w-[14rem] text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
							mid-market plants in CA &amp; US Northeast with no affordable option
						</div>
						<svg class="mt-4 h-10 w-full max-w-[12rem] text-[var(--color-text-dim)] md:hidden" viewBox="0 0 200 40" fill="none">
							<path d="M10 20 L190 20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
						</svg>
					</div>

					<!-- MidMon -->
					<div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-[#2dd4bf]/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2dd4bf]/10 to-[#60a5fa]/5 p-6">
						<div class="absolute -top-2 left-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#2dd4bf]/40 bg-[#04080f] px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest text-[#2dd4bf] uppercase">
							MidMon
						</div>
						<div class="text-[10px] tracking-widest text-[var(--color-text-dim)] uppercase">Mid-market</div>
						<div class="mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold text-white">&lt; $10K per line</div>
						<ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
							<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
								<svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#2dd4bf]" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
									<path d="M3 8.5L7 12 13 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
								</svg>
								Self-installing, no specialist required
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
								<svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#2dd4bf]" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
									<path d="M3 8.5L7 12 13 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
								</svg>
								On-device AI &mdash; no cloud dependency
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
								<svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#2dd4bf]" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
									<path d="M3 8.5L7 12 13 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
								</svg>
								Sub-PO threshold: a plant manager can approve it alone
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
